{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model-block sampling statements so that all parameters (`theta_trans`, `mu`, and `tau`) receive their built-in prior sampling statements before the protected observation `y` is scored. This is a same-density mechanical change because Stan sampling statement contributions are additive and commutative. No data changes were made; `sigma` and `J` remain context inputs.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> J; // number of schools
  array[J] real y; // estimated treatment
  array[J] real<lower=0> sigma; // std of estimated effect
}
parameters {
  vector[J] theta_trans; // transformation of theta
  real mu; // hyper-parameter of mean
  real<lower=0> tau; // hyper-parameter of sd
}
transformed parameters {
  vector[J] theta;
  // original theta
  theta = theta_trans * tau + mu;
}
model {
  theta_trans ~ normal(0, 1);
  mu ~ normal(0, 5); // a non-informative prior
  tau ~ cauchy(0, 5);
  y ~ normal(theta, sigma);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"J":3,"sigma":[1.2507321128332225,1.184967336363049,0.02755570894717583],"y":[4.729959607315234,3.358296910689676,3.3417570793018965]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
